# This template needs no environment variables.
# Form delivery (Formspree ID / GHL webhook URL) is set in
# src/config/site.config.json → "form". Both are public form endpoints.
#
# NEVER put private API keys (GHL API keys, SMTP passwords, etc.) in the
# site config or in any VITE_* variable — those are shipped to the browser.
#
# Optional build switch (Vercel sets VERCEL=1 automatically):
# DEPLOY_TARGET=vercel
